//=   command to disable being able to move items.
//= 1.6a Corrected a bad cutin, a Typo error ";;" and a bad delitem (bugreport:911) [Samuray22]
//= 1.6b Corrected a "donpcevent" missing a ":". (bugreport:962) [Samuray22]
